  "id": "mint-crusted-rack-of-lamb",
  "name": "Mint-Crusted Rack of Lamb",
  "subtitle": "Herb-crusted lamb with a tangy honey-mustard sauce",
  "description": "Tender racks of lamb are seared, coated with a savory mint crumb mixture, roasted, and served with a bright honey-mustard sauce.",
